WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,960
before that

2
00:00:01,440 --> 00:00:03,240
I want to save money to buy medicine for Nian Nian

3
00:00:03,760 --> 00:00:04,800
Cure her again

4
00:00:05,730 --> 00:00:07,210
Let her wear nice clothes too

5
00:00:07,450 --> 00:00:08,690
Eat meat and drink tea

6
00:00:09,290 --> 00:00:14,500
Live the same life as a young lady like you Gu Shiyi

7
00:00:15,140 --> 00:00:16,100
What about your wish?

8
00:00:16,610 --> 00:00:31,830
After eating a table full of meat, there is still no food left.

9
00:00:35,950 --> 00:00:36,990
After looking for so many years

10
00:00:37,270 --> 00:00:38,710
Even I thought she was dead

11
00:00:39,340 --> 00:00:40,820
I didn't expect it to appear suddenly

12
00:00:41,330 --> 00:00:43,170
The jade pendant and the dagger are in the same place

13
00:00:43,450 --> 00:00:45,210
It's a pity that I only got the jade pendant back then

14
00:00:45,210 --> 00:00:48,100
I don’t have a short sword now

15
00:00:48,380 --> 00:00:50,340
It's no use having them in one place now

16
00:00:51,220 --> 00:00:52,460
What's fake is fake

17
00:00:53,780 --> 00:00:56,020
But if there are only fake ones left in this world

18
00:00:56,500 --> 00:00:57,500
That fake one

19
00:00:57,820 --> 00:00:59,060
It's true

20
00:00:59,340 --> 00:01:00,700
Rumors in the past few years

21
00:01:00,820 --> 00:01:02,380
The one the Gu family found was fake

22
00:01:02,460 --> 00:01:03,460
really never found

23
00:01:03,540 --> 00:01:04,820
Just because the Gu family has internal and external troubles

24
00:01:05,060 --> 00:01:06,180
Bamboo and wood become auspicious secretly

25
00:01:06,260 --> 00:01:07,620
The head of the hometown, Xun Sun, is missing

26
00:01:07,900 --> 00:01:09,060
The family is almost clean

27
00:01:09,340 --> 00:01:11,540
By the way, I bet on you and you have a heavy talk.

28
00:01:11,980 --> 00:01:14,180
If the rumors are true, then

29
00:01:14,380 --> 00:01:16,700
Wouldn't it be better if I took the initiative to give you this short sword?
